pennsylvania/potter-county"],["PRF calculator","/prf"]],"story":"<p class=\"prf-lede prf-story\">As of Oct 12, the record from 1951 to 2025 shows September to October came in under 90% of normal in 34 of 75 years on the middle value of the county&rsquo;s 10 grids. In 2025, July to August finished at 56% of normal and August to September at 55% on the middle of the grids. In 2026 so far, March to April came in at 167% of normal there. Grid 25708 had its driest year in 1963 at 70% of normal.</p>"}
